{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29963","headline":"广德官舍二松 · 喻凫","name":"广德官舍二松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨公休簿领，二木日坚牢。\n直甚彰吾节，清终庇尔曹。\n幽阴月里细，冷树雪中高。\n谁见干霄後，枝飘白鹤毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}